      "path": "/books/al-kafi:7:2:24:2",
      "text": [
        " إِنَّ عَلِيّاً ( عليه السلام ) كَانَ يُوَرِّثُ ابْنَ الْأَخِ مَعَ الْجَدِّ مِيرَاثَ أَبِيهِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ali Bin Ibrahim, from Muhammad Bin Isa, from Yunus, from Al Qasim Bin Suleyman, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abullah<sup>asws</sup> having said that Ali<sup>asws</sup> would make a son of the brother (nephew) inherit with the grandfather, the inheritance of his father’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "2. Ali ibn Ibrahim has narrated from Muhammad ibn ‘Isa from Yunus from al-Qasim ibn Muhammad ibn Sulayman who has narrated the following: “Abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, has said that Ali, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, would make the son of a brother to inherit the share of his father with a grandfather.’” "
        ]
      }
